+Recipe times used to be free text only. This adds the structured columns (whole seconds) and moves
+every text that clearly is a duration into them, leaving the text for what is not a duration.
+
+The parsing lives in this file on purpose: it must keep doing what it did when it was written, even
+when the scraper's own parsing changes later.
+
